---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import ContactTurnstile from '../../components/ContactTurnstile.astro';
import { site } from '../../lib/site';
---
<Layout title="Contact an Employment or Immigration Lawyer | Barcelona" description="Contact López Márquez Abogados in Barcelona, Spain. Share the area, relevant date and essential facts so the firm can review your enquiry.">
<PageHero eyebrow="Contact" title="Tell us what you need help with." description="Choose an area, add any relevant date and briefly explain what happened. No legal terminology is needed." primaryLabel="Start enquiry" primaryHref="#consulta-form" secondaryLabel="Message us on WhatsApp" secondaryHref={site.whatsapp} />
<section class="section lm-contact-section"><div class="container contact-grid lm-contact-ux"><div class="contact-card lm-form-card"><span class="eyebrow">Online enquiry</span><h2>Tell us the essential facts</h2>
<div class="privacy-first-layer" aria-labelledby="privacy-layer-title">
  <h3 id="privacy-layer-title">Privacy and data</h3>
  <p id="consulta-privacidad">We use your name, email, area and message to handle the enquiry. Phone and date are optional. Do not send documents or identity, health or bank details.</p>
  <p class="small">Please read the <a href="/en/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> before submitting your enquiry.</p>
</div><div id="consulta-status" class="form-status" role="alert" aria-live="assertive" hidden></div>
<form id="consulta-form" data-endpoint="/api/contact" data-locale="en" aria-describedby="consulta-privacidad" method="post" action="/api/contact" autocomplete="on">
<input type="hidden" name="locale" value="en" /><input type="hidden" name="sourcePath" value="/en/contact" />
<div class="form-grid">
<div class="field"><label for="nombre">Name</label><input id="nombre" name="nombre" autocomplete="name" maxlength="120" required placeholder="Your name" /></div>
<div class="field"><label for="email">Email</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="254" required placeholder="Your email" /></div>
<div class="field field-phone"><label for="telefono">Phone (optional, only if you would prefer us to contact you this way)</label><input id="telefono" name="telefono" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" inputmode="tel" maxlength="25" placeholder="Your phone (optional)" /></div>
<div class="field"><label for="area">Area</label><select id="area" name="area" required><option value="">Select an area</option><option value="Employment">Employment</option><option value="Immigration">Immigration</option><option value="Business">Business</option><option value="Other legal matters">Other legal matters</option></select></div>
<div class="field full"><label for="fecha">Relevant date <span class="small">(optional, but useful)</span></label><input id="fecha" name="fecha" maxlength="40" placeholder="For example, DD/MM/YYYY" /></div>
<div class="field full"><label for="mensaje">What happened and what do you need to resolve?</label><textarea id="mensaje" name="mensaje" minlength="20" maxlength="4000" required placeholder="Explain the main facts in your own words, in the order they happened."></textarea></div>
<div class="field full"><p class="callout urgent-deadline-note"><strong>Is a deadline approaching?</strong> Call us to assess the urgency. Sending this form does not by itself suspend or interrupt a legal deadline.</p></div>
<div class="field full honeypot-field" aria-hidden="true"><label for="website">Website</label><input id="website" name="website" class="honeypot" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></div>
<div class="field full"><label class="checkbox"><input id="privacy" name="privacy" type="checkbox" required /><span>I have read the <a href="/en/privacy">privacy policy</a> and agree to the processing necessary to respond to my enquiry.</span></label></div>
<ContactTurnstile locale="en" />
<div class="field full lm-submit-row"><button class="btn btn-dark" type="submit">Send enquiry</button><p class="small">The form is submitted directly from this website. It does not open your email application.</p></div>
</div></form></div>
<div class="lm-contact-sidebar">
<div class="contact-card contact-whatsapp-card"><span class="eyebrow">WhatsApp</span><h3>Prefer to write?</h3><p>You can start the enquiry by message, without making a phone call.</p><a class="btn btn-dark" href={site.whatsapp} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-track="whatsapp_click">Message us on WhatsApp →</a></div>
<div class="contact-card contact-email-card"><span class="eyebrow">Email</span><h3>{site.email}</h3><p>The form is recommended, but you can also email the firm directly.</p><a class="link-arrow" href={site.emailHref} data-track="email_click">Send an email →</a></div>
<div class="contact-card contact-phone-card"><span class="eyebrow">You can also</span><h3>{site.phone}</h3><a href={site.phoneHref} data-track="phone_click">Call the firm →</a><p class="small">For an initial enquiry. Do not send sensitive documents by WhatsApp unless we specifically give you the appropriate channel.</p></div>
<div class="contact-card contact-process"><span class="eyebrow">What happens next</span><h3>We assess the enquiry and the next step.</h3><ol>
  <li><strong>We read the initial information.</strong> The situation, area and dates that may matter.</li>
  <li><strong>We assess fit and urgency.</strong> We identify which points may need a closer review.</li>
  <li><strong>We explain the next step.</strong> If useful, we tell you which documents to prepare.</li>
  <li><strong>We define the engagement.</strong> If you decide to proceed, we explain the proposed work and fees before starting.</li>
</ol></div>
<div class="contact-card contact-scenarios-card"><span class="eyebrow">What do you need to solve?</span><div class="scenario-links">
<a href="?area=Employment#consulta-form" data-area="Employment">Employment issue →</a>
<a href="?area=Immigration#consulta-form" data-area="Immigration">Immigration or residence →</a>
<a href="?area=Business#consulta-form" data-area="Business">Business matter →</a>
<a href="?area=Other%20legal%20matters#consulta-form" data-area="Other legal matters">Another legal issue →</a>
</div></div>
<div class="contact-card contact-address-card"><span class="eyebrow">Barcelona office</span><h3>{site.address.street}</h3><p>{site.address.postalCode} {site.address.locality}, Spain</p><a class="link-arrow" href={site.maps} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-track="maps_click">Open Google Maps →</a></div>
</div></div></section>
</Layout>
